--! Where this build of Conduit is served, and where its API is. These are
--! the defaults: the app at the root of its origin, with the API at `/api`
--! on the same origin, as `beni serve` and the corpus pages serve it. The
--! GitHub Pages build (`examples/build-pages.mjs`) writes this module again
--! in its copy of the project, with the path the site serves the app under
--! and a public demo API.

--| The path the app is served under, with no `/` at the end: `""` at the
--| root of the origin. A route's address starts with it, and an address
--| that does not start with it is no route.
pub basePath : String
basePath = ""


--| The origin the API is at, with no `/` at the end: `""` for the page's
--| own origin.
pub apiOrigin : String
apiOrigin = ""
